# AI-denoise/upscale model weights (item 13) — large (hundreds of MB),
# not committed by decision (2026-08-29): downloaded locally for now,
# distribution mechanism (release asset? first-run download?) TBD.
# Moved out of windows/native/ 2026-09-01 (shared with the Linux build,
# awkward living inside a platform-specific folder).
flutter_app/native_models/*.onnx

# Dev convenience: `dart run tool/*.dart` harnesses resolve models through
# DARKMOON_NATIVE_DIR/models, which is the layout the built app has but not
# the layout the repo has. A junction/symlink here pointing at
# native_models/ bridges the two without copying a gigabyte.
flutter_app/windows/native/models/
flutter_app/linux/native/models/

